    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 219,000\n\nThis is a 93 sqm semi-detached home in a cul-de-sac setting in this ever popular estate.On the ground floor is the living room with large front-facing window and open fire, and to the rear is the kitchen/dining area with direct access to the west facing rear garden. Originally a guest WC, the area under the stairs is currently in use as a utility room with washing machine and dryer.Upstairs are three bedrooms (main bedroom with an en-suite) and family bathroom. In terms of location, Mount Prospect will always be popular with local amenities so nearby and with St Peters Square approximately 2.5 km away, all that Wexford Town has to offer is an easy distance.West facing rear garden, off-street parking, 93 sqm semi-detached home, mains services. \nOutside shed and rad covers are not included in the sale."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.2m x 1.8m\nwith laminte flooring and utility/guest WC off\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m x 3.3m\nwith large front facing window, laminate flooring and open fire\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.2m x 4m\nwith laminate flooring, waist and eye level units, 5 ring gas hob and electric oven, patio door to west facing rear garden\n\nUtility Room/Guest WC - 1.3m x 0.9m\ncurrently used for washing machine/tumble dryer - plumbing still there to turn back into guest WC\n\nLanding - 2.2m x 1.9m\nwith carpet flooring and large window, attic hatch (attic is part sheeted for storage)\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.1m x 3.2m\nrear facing room with laminate flooring, built in wardrobe and en-suite\n\nEn-Suite - 2m x 1.5m\nwith tiled floor and shower surround, WC, WHB and electric shower\n\nHot Press - 1.1m x 0.6m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 2.8m\nwith laminate flooring and built-in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.8m x 2.3m\nwith laminate flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>93 sqm semi-detached home</li><li>Living room with large front facing window</li><li>Kitchen/dining to the rear with patio doors</li><li>West facing rear garden</li><li>Three bedrooms, main with en-suite</li><li>Mains services, off street parking, OFCH</li><li>Cul de sac setting</li><li>Built 2000</ul>"
      },
